{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/3cb2068930ff2df0eb09c96c3dbfbf85.avif?t=1762010226\" width=630 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You awaken disoriented, tattooed and abandoned in a hellish warzone with no memory. The distant gunfire is the least of your worries as deranged cultists  hunt you down, their unintelligible screams pierce the chaos as they charge clumsily toward you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/19c3f8c42284fdc5190e967f11b83da7.poster.avif?t=1762010226\" width=608 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/19c3f8c42284fdc5190e967f11b83da7.webm?t=1762010226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command the Swarm, Control the Chaos\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Command Your Rat Army\u00a0\u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone. Command an ever-growing army of loyal rat companions to overwhelm your enemies and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Master the Arsenal\u00a0\u00ab</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the rapid-fire Thompson M1A1 to the powerful Trench Gun, find your favorite tool of destruction on the walls of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Arcade Minigames\u00a0\u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Arcade Room is a change of pace from the main combat loop, where players can test their skills in minigames like Basketball to earn valuable Tickets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/fb747797d0742f7f302d86eb686d789b.poster.avif?t=1762010226\" width=608 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/fb747797d0742f7f302d86eb686d789b.webm?t=1762010226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Army, Define Your Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Build Your Rat Army\u00a0\u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every wave, rescue a new rat with a unique name, rarity, and attributes. Find rare &quot;Creamy&quot; rats with run-altering passive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Embrace the Cream Machine\u00a0\u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to drink from the Cream Machine? Spend tickets to consume its strange liquid for powerful, permanent perks that boost your damage, increase your health, and alter your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/f20755ae5eebac121bfe5491725617d3.poster.avif?t=1762010226\" width=608 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/f20755ae5eebac121bfe5491725617d3.webm?t=1762010226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endure the Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Face the Horde \u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can against increasingly difficult waves of terrifying enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb A Hellish, War-Torn World \u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark, oppressive nightmare world of Milo, command your rats to consume corpses to gain special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Climb the Leaderboards\u00a0\u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival is ranked. Compete against players worldwide for the top spot and prove who can endure the longest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wishlist Now and Join the Discord to Keep Up With Development.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The horde is coming. The rats are hungry. Milo is watching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/9934b9abf444e3483a1f582fe97e2adf.poster.avif?t=1762010226\" width=600 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/9934b9abf444e3483a1f582fe97e2adf.webm?t=1762010226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/c92a2c5a2cfd050432b5f0f282df0d90.poster.avif?t=1762010226\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/c92a2c5a2cfd050432b5f0f282df0d90.webm?t=1762010226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Blood, gore/dismemberment, custom procedural animation, and enemy AI was designed from the ground-up to make every play session feel unique and satisfying</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2665020?t=1762010226","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762010226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/0f4bcc20e1b4748e3c6096a71f571ecda41966d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762010226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/0f4bcc20e1b4748e3c6096a71f571ecda41966d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762010226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Milo contains graphic violence and gore. You use various weapons to attack and there are rats that eat corpses. "},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2691620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/e68196f8661195b82380034486b0f9ab.avif?t=1762010226\" width=630 height=230 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00bb Phase 1: Expanding the Core Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arsenal Expansion:</strong> We're overhauling the armory with new weapons, updated animations, and a full weapon skin system to personalize your loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overhauled Perk System:</strong> The Cream Machine is just the beginning. We're designing a deeper perk system with more strategic choices and powerful synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Rat Mechanics:</strong> Your swarm will become more complex and strategic. We're developing deeper companion mechanics, giving you more ways to command and interact with your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00bb Phase 2: Deepening Player Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Player Classes:</strong> More distinct playstyles are coming. We will be introducing new classes, each with unique starting loadouts, attributes, and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Perk Abilities:</strong> Expect to see a massive injection of new and unique perks, allowing for even more diverse and powerful character builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Ways to Play:</strong> Look forward to a variety of new minigames in the Arcade Room, offering fresh challenges and more ways to earn tickets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00bb Phase 3: Evolving the Nightmare</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Threats Emerge:</strong> The cult is evolving. Prepare to face new specialized enemy types designed to counter your strategies and create new tactical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World Grows:</strong> The fight will spread to various new maps, each with unique layouts, strategic challenges, and horrifying atmospheres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rat Customization:</strong> Make your army your own with unique rat skins and other cosmetic customizations for your loyal companions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/3cb2068930ff2df0eb09c96c3dbfbf85.avif?t=1762010226\" width=630 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You awaken disoriented, tattooed and abandoned in a hellish warzone with no memory. The distant gunfire is the least of your worries as deranged cultists  hunt you down, their unintelligible screams pierce the chaos as they charge clumsily toward you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/19c3f8c42284fdc5190e967f11b83da7.poster.avif?t=1762010226\" width=608 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/19c3f8c42284fdc5190e967f11b83da7.webm?t=1762010226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command the Swarm, Control the Chaos\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Command Your Rat Army\u00a0\u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone. Command an ever-growing army of loyal rat companions to overwhelm your enemies and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Master the Arsenal\u00a0\u00ab</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the rapid-fire Thompson M1A1 to the powerful Trench Gun, find your favorite tool of destruction on the walls of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Arcade Minigames\u00a0\u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Arcade Room is a change of pace from the main combat loop, where players can test their skills in minigames like Basketball to earn valuable Tickets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/fb747797d0742f7f302d86eb686d789b.poster.avif?t=1762010226\" width=608 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/fb747797d0742f7f302d86eb686d789b.webm?t=1762010226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Army, Define Your Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Build Your Rat Army\u00a0\u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every wave, rescue a new rat with a unique name, rarity, and attributes. Find rare &quot;Creamy&quot; rats with run-altering passive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Embrace the Cream Machine\u00a0\u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to drink from the Cream Machine? Spend tickets to consume its strange liquid for powerful, permanent perks that boost your damage, increase your health, and alter your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/f20755ae5eebac121bfe5491725617d3.poster.avif?t=1762010226\" width=608 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/f20755ae5eebac121bfe5491725617d3.webm?t=1762010226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endure the Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Face the Horde \u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can against increasingly difficult waves of terrifying enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb A Hellish, War-Torn World \u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark, oppressive nightmare world of Milo, command your rats to consume corpses to gain special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00bb Climb the Leaderboards\u00a0\u00ab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival is ranked. Compete against players worldwide for the top spot and prove who can endure the longest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78\ud83e\ude78</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wishlist Now and Join the Discord to Keep Up With Development.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The horde is coming. The rats are hungry. Milo is watching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/9934b9abf444e3483a1f582fe97e2adf.poster.avif?t=1762010226\" width=600 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/9934b9abf444e3483a1f582fe97e2adf.webm?t=1762010226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/c92a2c5a2cfd050432b5f0f282df0d90.poster.avif?t=1762010226\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/c92a2c5a2cfd050432b5f0f282df0d90.webm?t=1762010226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Blood, gore/dismemberment, custom procedural animation, and enemy AI was designed from the ground-up to make every play session feel unique and satisfying</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Spencer Sharp","rat cream games LLC","Yarrawah Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/adeede75839fae152e3e0fb43145182bd427c367/header.jpg?t=